<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2707] Should use the relative path for all images in documentation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2707</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;using images in &lt;tt&gt;/asset&lt;/tt&gt; (the absolute path) is actually invalid. That&apos;s because each version has its own image directory. So they should use the relative path. (&lt;tt&gt;BASE_PATH&lt;/tt&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
